  "Name": "Area-牆心產生範圍線",
  "ElementResolver": {
    "ResolutionMap": {}
  },
  "Inputs": [
    {
      "Id": "49b8d920a16240229b8609c7b810efe6",
      "Name": "String",
      "Type": "string",
      "Type2": "string",
      "Value": "Area-牆心產生範圍線--\r\n選到你要計算面積的平面視圖(建地平面圖)，然後按下確定就會在各牆面中心線畫上面積的邊界線；注意陽臺是算在外皮所以你要移動一下面積邊界線的位置...",
      "Description": "建立一個字串。"
    }
  ],
  "Outputs": [
    {
      "Id": "7395ec8163e64d3baf8a69c9b70d3584",
      "Name": "Watch",
      "Type": "unknown",
      "InitialValue": "",
      "Description": "視覺化節點的輸出"
    }
  ],
  "Nodes": [
    {
      "ConcreteType": "PythonNodeModels.PythonNode, PythonNodeModels",
      "Code": "import clr\r\nimport sys\r\n\r\n# 載入 Revit API\r\nclr.AddReference('RevitAPI')\r\nfrom Autodesk.Revit.DB import *\r\n\r\n# 載入 Document Manager 和 Transaction Manager\r\nclr.AddReference('RevitServices')\r\nimport RevitServices\r\nfrom RevitServices.Persistence import DocumentManager\r\nfrom RevitServices.Transactions import TransactionManager\r\n\r\n# 取得當前文件與作用中的視圖\r\ndoc = DocumentManager.Instance.CurrentDBDocument\r\nactive_view = doc.ActiveView\r\n\r\n# --- 1. 直接從當前視圖抓取牆元素 ---\r\n# 使用 FilteredElementCollector，限定只在 active_view 的範圍內搜尋\r\ncollector = FilteredElementCollector(doc, active_view.Id)\r\n\r\n# 過濾出類別為「牆」(OST_Walls) 且為「實體元素」(非類型) 的物件\r\nwalls = collector.OfCategory(BuiltInCategory.OST_Walls).WhereElementIsNotElementType().ToElements()\r\n\r\ncurves = []\r\n\r\n# --- 2. 收集所有牆心線 ---\r\nfor wall in walls:\r\n    if hasattr(wall, \"Location\"):\r\n        loc = wall.Location\r\n        if isinstance(loc, LocationCurve):\r\n            curves.append(loc.Curve)\r\n\r\ncreated_lines = []\r\n\r\n# --- 3. 開啟交易，生成區域邊界線 ---\r\n# 再次確認是否在面積平面圖\r\nif active_view.ViewType != ViewType.AreaPlan:\r\n    OUT = [\"錯誤：當前視圖不是「面積平面圖」。請切換視圖後再試。\"]\r\nelse:\r\n    if len(curves) > 0:\r\n        TransactionManager.Instance.EnsureInTransaction(doc)\r\n        \r\n        try:\r\n            # 取得或自動生成當前視圖的工作平面\r\n            sketch_plane = active_view.SketchPlane\r\n            if sketch_plane is None:\r\n                level = active_view.GenLevel\r\n                plane = Plane.CreateByNormalAndOrigin(XYZ.BasisZ, XYZ(0, 0, level.Elevation))\r\n                sketch_plane = SketchPlane.Create(doc, plane)\r\n            \r\n            # 使用單數 NewAreaBoundaryLine，並用迴圈一條一條畫\r\n            for curve in curves:\r\n                # 語法：NewAreaBoundaryLine(工作平面, 單一線段, 面積平面圖)\r\n                new_line = doc.Create.NewAreaBoundaryLine(sketch_plane, curve, active_view)\r\n                created_lines.append(new_line)\r\n                \r\n            TransactionManager.Instance.TransactionTaskDone()\r\n            OUT = created_lines # 成功輸出\r\n            \r\n        except Exception as e:\r\n            TransactionManager.Instance.ForceCloseTransaction()\r\n            OUT = [\"發生錯誤: \" + str(e)]\r\n    else:\r\n        OUT = [\"在當前視圖沒有找到有效的牆心線\"]",
      "Engine": "CPython3",
      "VariableInputPorts": true,
      "Id": "ca5530f1f8694bec9c39e59ab5f9d686",
      "NodeType": "PythonScriptNode",
      "Inputs": [],
      "Outputs": [
